  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "*'Break my organization with my own hands.'*\n\nGang-Jin Faction boss Lee Gang-Jin is the last skilled gangster in the dark world.\n\nHe unified the country with his fists and rose to the top, but was betrayed by his favorite *dongsaeng* Jo Du-Yeong and died.\n\nAt the moment of his death, he wakes up in the body of Lee Gang-Jin, a high schooler who took his own life due to school violent.\n\nMeanwhile, the Gang-Jin Faction starts a 'Kkanglin Audition' under the pretext of recruiting young members, and delinquent teenages are eager to join.\n\nAfter repeated regrets, Gang-Jin decides to take control of the Gang-Jin Faction he founded with his own hands to reverse everything...\n\n(Source: Kakao Webtoon, translated)",
